+# Claude context index
+
+Every documentation surface that feeds Claude sessions on this machine, by load behavior.
+A map, not more guidance — pointers only; the spine's contraction rule applies here too.
+Word counts are a 2026-08-04 snapshot; regenerate with `wc -w`.
+
+## Always loaded — every session
+
+| surface | path | words |
+|---|---|---|
+| Spine (hard rules + defaults) | `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` → `~/.dotfiles/CLAUDE.md` | 665 |
+| ↳ dotfiles topic | `~/.dotfiles/claude/dotfiles.md` | 402 |
+| ↳ forests topic (all forest shape/config/restack rules) | `~/.dotfiles/claude/forests.md` | 1,063 |
+| ↳ loops topic | `~/.dotfiles/claude/loops.md` | 500 |
+| ↳ style topic | `~/.dotfiles/claude/style.md` | 506 |
+| loops memory index (hooks only) | `~/.claude/projects/-Users-philbrockman-coding-loops/memory/MEMORY.md` | ~1,200 |
+
+≈4.3k words of always-on context in a loops session. Skill *descriptions* also ride in every
+session (bodies don't — see below).
+
+## Loaded on recall — memory topic files
+
+- `~/.claude/projects/-Users-philbrockman-coding-loops/memory/` — 345 files, ~187k words.
+  Only MEMORY.md auto-loads; topic files surface by description match or by following an index hook.
+- `MEMORY-archive.md` (same dir) — closed chapters; checked before re-proposing dead work.
+
+## Loaded on invocation — skills (`~/.dotfiles/.claude/skills/`)
+
+reforest 751 · land-forest 525 · design 1,126 · tutor 1,085 · loops-lmx 990 (+5,648 refs) ·
+loops-restart 698 · trigger-doi 664 · bench-shas 651 · loops-preview 556 · prwatch 542 ·
+loops-email-sending-best-practices 502 (+1,952 refs) · dev-tail 447 · ticket-check 390
+
+reforest + land-forest defer all forest rules to `claude/forests.md` (one governing text).
+Harness-bundled skills (artifact-*, dataviz, run, …) are Anthropic-owned — not indexed here.
+
+## Agents & commands
+
+- `~/.claude/agents/reforest.md` (1,551) — subagent definition; self-contained by design.
+  ⚠ carries its own copy of the forest principles — the remaining duplicate of forests.md.
+- `~/.claude/commands/log.md` (198) — `/log`.
+
+## Per-repo
+
+- loops: no repo CLAUDE.md — global spine only.
+- `~/coding/kerrigan/CLAUDE.md` (1,111) — kerrigan sessions only.
+
+## Adjacent (not injected, but shapes sessions)
+
+- `~/.dotfiles/OWNERS` — lane map, read by `own` and the own-hook.
+- Hooks (`~/.claude/settings.json`): own-hook (PreToolUse lane guard), claude-session-track
+  (SessionStart presence) — enforcement/telemetry; their output reaches Claude as tool feedback.
+- Viewer Wiki tab — human-facing docs; in context only when a session reads them.
